WEBVTT

NOTE Draft authored captions. Pronunciation review pending.

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.949
Before allowing an onchain agent to act, compare what its decision changes.

2
00:00:06.487 --> 00:00:10.079
This is the actual Entrotter viewer, with synthetic narration.

3
00:00:11.131 --> 00:00:16.628
This saved recording tests supplied collateral and borrow actions on Ethereum.

4
00:00:17.187 --> 00:00:21.686
Today we inspect that recording. We do not execute a new historical run.

5
00:00:22.724 --> 00:00:29.519
Both isolated branches start with the same artificial twenty Ether and local account impersonation.

6
00:00:30.102 --> 00:00:34.362
The supplied setup wraps, approves, and supplies ten wrapped Ether.

7
00:00:35.431 --> 00:00:38.583
A nine wrapped Ether borrow reverts in the baseline.

8
00:00:39.143 --> 00:00:44.411
The candidate uses a built in current state preflight policy and holds that proposal.

9
00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:49.999
This case uses a deterministic policy, not a new language model call.

10
00:00:51.038 --> 00:00:55.209
A later one wrapped Ether borrow succeeds in both branches.

11
00:00:55.728 --> 00:01:00.357
That smaller action was supplied in advance. The policy did not generate it.

12
00:01:01.403 --> 00:01:06.481
Compare every recorded native and token balance without losing decimal precision.

13
00:01:07.008 --> 00:01:13.423
The held revert changes gas use, but gas prices also differ. These differences are not profit.

14
00:01:14.501 --> 00:01:18.901
Download the exact source recording, then open the pinned command recipe.

15
00:01:19.459 --> 00:01:24.467
The setup selects immutable public command line and Python reader versions.

16
00:01:25.482 --> 00:01:28.994
Use the keyboard to copy the inspection command for this sample.

17
00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:35.366
Only the fixed public command is copied. Local report metadata never enters shell text.

18
00:01:36.426 --> 00:01:41.793
Here is actual command output from the downloaded recording, using those pinned sources.

19
00:01:42.342 --> 00:01:47.880
The command verifies the content hash and preserves the same exact units and recorded decision.

20
00:01:48.946 --> 00:01:55.232
Integrity does not establish provider authenticity, a correct policy, or future market behavior.

21
00:01:55.792 --> 00:02:02.556
This is supplied action execution on archived state, not replay of original signed transactions.

22
00:02:03.595 --> 00:02:08.893
Use Entrotter to keep the inputs, receipts, assumptions, and decisions together for review.

23
00:02:09.445 --> 00:02:16.419
The current code is on development branches. Main integration, public deployment, and submission remain separate.
